# Generated OMO evidence datasets can exceed GitHub's per-object limit.
# Keep the textual receipts/transcripts, but do not commit synthetic case DBs.
.omo/evidence/**/db/
.omo/evidence/**/performance/db/

# Do not accidentally commit client media or forensic images.
